decented-net
============

Parts of this crate are adapted from Axe'n'Stax, source commit
bdd4fe877acf3a6f4ca3174d1ce79c6672935e2f, game/engine/src/:

  nat/stun.rs, nat/upnp.rs, nat/candidates.rs, nat/punch.rs  -> src/nat/ (copied, app coupling removed)
  network.rs                                                 -> src/quic.rs (framing, configs, connect race; datagrams re-enabled)
  rendezvous/relay_client.rs, native_mailbox/relay.rs        -> src/relay.rs (tag filter generalised)
  rendezvous/payload.rs, rendezvous/verify.rs                -> src/rendezvous.rs (attestation removed)
  discovery.rs                                               -> src/lan.rs (rewritten beacon)

